{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_llr54lj2hoblsjkg7vfta7eqbifzd2f7axfrv6r3tf5loq6npt37","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01pQHwuacgQ0CBYqNEotQkyk","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"OSpQg4xGeF4nGeThS4dweb","description":"Read all text from Start Here and Foundations pages","code":"const out=[];\nfor (const id of ['0:1','1:2']) {\n  const p = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);\n  await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(p);\n  out.push('=== '+p.name);\n  const walk=(n,d)=>{\n    let line='  '.repeat(d)+n.type+' '+n.id+' \"'+n.name+'\"';\n    if('width' in n) line+=` ${Math.round(n.x)},${Math.round(n.y)} ${Math.round(n.width)}x${Math.round(n.height)}`;\n    if(n.type==='TEXT') line+=' :: '+n.characters;\n    if(n.fills && n.fills.length && n.fills[0].type==='SOLID' && n.type!=='TEXT'){const c=n.fills[0].color;line+=' fill:'+[c.r,c.g,c.b].map(v=>Math.round(v*255).toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('');}\n    out.push(line);\n    if('children' in n) n.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,d+1));\n  };\n  p.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,0));\n}\nreturn out.join('\\n');"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":968,"cache_read_input_tokens":7910,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":968,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":38,"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b5637fe1-f7ad-4e4d-a152-4164325ec48e","uuid":"1aaa74d6-5469-442f-a2d0-314390865d78","timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:31:57.232Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01pQHwuacgQ0CBYqNEotQkyk","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01pQHwuacgQ0CBYqNEotQkyk","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 00 · Start Here 设计任务\nFRAME 4:2 \"Start Here · Brief\" 0,0 1440x3091 fill:ffffff\n  FRAME 4:3 \"Header\" 64,64 1312x145\n    TEXT 4:4 \"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" 0,0 182x19 :: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n    TEXT 4:5 \"Workout Class — fitness classes and activity tracking\" 0,31 1312x52 :: Workout Class — fitness classes and activity tracking\n    TEXT 4:6 \"Design a fitness class app: get started, find a workout class, open the Warm up category to see its exercises, and review this week’s activity. Canvas 414 × 896, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" 0,95 1312x50 :: Design a fitness class app: get started, find a workout class, open the Warm up category to see its exercises, and review this week’s activity. Canvas 414 × 896, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  FRAME 4:7 \"How to work\" 64,257 1312x227\n    TEXT 4:8 \"How to work\" 0,0 147x35 :: How to work\n    TEXT 4:9 \"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the illustrations, the avata