{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_2j7wtezt2csqoge6urndlsw5t3blkvh4artqo3bbaswz4h4ymyjr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":69,"cache_creation_input_tokens":893,"cache_read_input_tokens":123398,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":893,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b5637fe1-f7ad-4e4d-a152-4164325ec48e","uuid":"d7ad2c52-55b5-4ee0-bcb1-65695d31eb5a","timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:50:08.327Z","thinking_duration_ms":7780}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_2j7wtezt2csqoge6urndlsw5t3blkvh4artqo3bbaswz4h4ymyjr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built the complete design in 03 · Workspace: the 4 screens, the reusable components and the prototype. I checked each screen with a screenshot and fixed what looked wrong. Three screens scroll and the screenshots only capture the first 896 px. For the parts below that, I read the data out of the nodes instead: all 10 exercise rows and all 3 activity cards have the right text and photos. The reference pages (00, 01, 02, 04) were only read, not changed. Account: zuohaosheng@tetras.ai.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/OSpQg4xGeF4nGeThS4dweb/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `5:2`\n\n**Screens** (414 × 896)\n\n| Frame | ID | Contents |\n|---|---|---|\n| 01_Onboarding | `14:343` | Onboarding illustration, \"Best workouts for you\", body copy, \"Get started\" button |\n| 02_Home | `14:367` | Avatar with \"Hello, Adam Smith\" and menu, title, search, Today's activity card (8.00 AM - 1.30 PM), Categories (Warm up, Yoga, Squats, Lunge, each with its photo), Recommendation Class (Yoga Class, With Rachael Wisdom, favorite), \"See all\" ×2, tab bar on Home. Scrolls. |\n| 03_Warm_Up | `16:297` | Seated Hug video cover with back, more and play buttons, \"Warm up\", tags 37.10 mins and Running, description, Exercises 1–10 with the right photos and durations, tab bar on Home. Scrolls. |\n| 04_Activity | `17:499` | Back, more, \"Your activities\", This week Sat 26 – Fri 01 with Mon 28 selected, 1680 kcal, chart (8AM–4PM, 4PM selected, 120 cal), Running, Swimming and Cycling cards, tab bar on Activity. Scrolls. |\n\nOn the scrolling screens the status bar, header, tab bar and home indicator stay fixed.\n\n**Prototype** (flow \"Workout Class flow\" starts on 01)\n- 01 Get started → 02\n- 02 Warm up category card → 03 (slides in)\n- 02 Activity tab → 04\n- 03 back → 02, and 03 Activity tab → 04\n- 04 back → 02, and 04 Home tab → 02\n\nI also added some state changes inside components:\n- The button changes to its pressed look while pressed.\n- The heart on the class card toggles favorite on and off.\n- Tapping an exercise row switches it to a \"Playing\" look.\n- Category cards change to a pressed look while pressed.\n\n**Design system and components** (board \"WC · Components\", `9:2`)\n- **Tokens:** a set of color variables (brand #24C8FE, neutrals, text, surfaces, category tints, a color for each activity, favorite and error), spacing and radius values, 8 Inter text styles, and 3 shadow styles.\n- **Components:**\n  - Tab Item and Tab Bar, each with a version for every tab being the current one\n  - Icon Button and Nav Header\n  - Search Bar, built from the given Text Field\n  - Primary Button (default, pressed, disabled), built from the given Button\n  - Tag, Today Activity Card, Class Card (favorite on/off), Category Card and Exercise Row\n  - Day Pill and Hour Label (selected or not), Calories Chart, and Activity Card (Running, Swimming, Cycling)\n- All media are used as instances of the 04 · Media components, and icons are recolored to match the design.\n\n**Limitations**\n- The menu, avatar, search, \"See all\", Yoga Class and play video are visible but go nowhere, as the brief says they should. The same applies to the Profile and Settings tabs, days, hours and activity cards.\n- Selecting another day or chart hour isn't wired as a click. Each one has a selected look as a component variant, and Mon 28 and 4PM are shown selected.\n- I added a few short labels that aren't in the fixed copy: \"TODAY\", \"Calories burned\", the \"Mon 28\" chip next to the calories, \"Activities\", and the \"Sat 26 – Fri 01\" text next to the day pills."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":69,"cache_creation_input_tokens":893,"cache_read_input_tokens":123398,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_in